// Strings the GeneralsX port adds to the game, in chinese.
// Same format as generals.str (languages/README.md). Read after the game's own text,
// so a full language pack that defines one of these labels takes precedence.
// A language without this file shows the English one from languages/english/.

// Steam release "Custom Mission" button (PatchWindow.big, MainMenu.wnd)
GUI:CustomMission
"自定义任务"
END

// Touch force-attack button on the command bar (issue #25)
GX:ForceAttack
"强制攻击"
END

GX:ToolTipForceAttack
"攻击下一个点击的目标，即使是己方单位或空地"
END
